        <author ref="http://syriaca.org/person/239" source="#bib5745-1 #bib5745-2" xml:lang="en">Gregorius bar Hebraeus — <foreign xml:lang="syr">ܓܪܝܓܘܪܝܘܣ ܒܪ ܥܒܪܝܐ</foreign>
